# Private ops panel. This repo is PUBLIC and deploys to m3xi.com, so committing
# panel/ would publish the subscription/credit status of every service — which
# is a map of what is unfinished and unpaid across the whole stack. It holds no
# credentials, but it is not for strangers. Keep it local; run it with
# `npm run dev` and open /panel/.
panel/
